                <p rendition="#center">C.—<hi rendition="#italic">Annex to No</hi>. 11 <hi
                        rendition="#italic">of the final protocol.</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Notice concerning the maximum amount
